«
@@ ============================================================
@@ WPDel — remove waypoint n from the route.
@@
@@ If the active leg (RouteLeg) comes after position n, it is moved up
@@ by one, so that it keeps pointing to the same waypoints.
@@ ============================================================

  → pos
  «
    'Route' RCL
    → rtl
    «
      IF pos 1 > THEN rtl 1 pos 1 - SUB ELSE { } END
      rtl pos 1 + rtl SIZE SUB +
      'Route' STO
      IFERR 'RouteLeg' RCL THEN DROP ELSE
        IF DUP pos ≥ OVER 1 > AND THEN 1 - 'RouteLeg' STO ELSE DROP END
      END
    »
  »
»
